<title>USA: NYSE closing averages.</title>
<headline>NYSE closing averages.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Prices on the New York Stock Exchange closed narrowly mixed in moderate trading.</p>
<p>The Dow Jones Industrial Average rose 1.16 to 7922.98.</p>
<p>The NYSE Composite fell 0.01 to 478.11.</p>
<p>The average price per share was unchanged.</p>
<p>Advancers beat decliners 1471 to 1375.</p>
<p>Volume was 485,853,540 compared with 499,879,790 on Friday.</p>
<p>(Prices official as of 1630 EDT/2030 GMT).</p>
<p>((-- Wall Street desk, 212-859-1730))</p>
